10. She is not part of the unofficial Discord server, as she is shy and only Mozu is involved from her side. (Verbatim: "there's an unofficial discord where everyone is welcome there is i'm not in it um... because i myself am shy") [end of text]



1. She has a shy personality and avoids participating in her own Discord server. (Verbatim: "i myself am shy... i am not there at all can confirm i do not see i genuinely do not see")

